ould you also email me the price list and pictures? sophorn_h@yahoo.ca&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1816558,"PostDate":1385227949,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello, I am planning on getting married there next year Nov 2014 as well. Could you also email me the price list and pictures? sophorn_h@yahoo.ca<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sophorn_h@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"173.206.188.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385227651,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275275.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sophie13","Id":275275,"Name":"sophie13","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66259,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ae3e9d626e76e306993a2e010602dd4f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;I am thinking of getting married there Nov 2014. Would you be able to send me a price list? Did you have the semi-private dinner? How was that? Would you be able to send me some pictures of the decorations, tables, centrepieces, etc? Thanks so much, my email is sophorn_h@yahoo.ca&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1816559,"PostDate":1385228074,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi,<\/p> <p>I am thinking of getting married there Nov 2014. Would you be able to send me a price list? Did you have the semi-private dinner? How was that? Would you be able to send me some pictures of the decorations, tables, centrepieces, etc? Thanks so much, my email is sophorn_h@yahoo.ca<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sophorn_h@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"173.206.188.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385227651,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275275.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sophie13","Id":275275,"Name":"sophie13","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.241.86.225","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66259,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1eef5ebf412b73e244fde2d7b11feee0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;having a destination wedding at the RIU Guanacaste November 2015 and would be interested in hearing an honest opinion from someone who had a wedding there. I have been exchanging e-mails with the wedding coordinators which can be a little frustrating since I have a lot of questions. Would hope for my time there to be as stress free as possible but would love to hear about someone&#039;s experience and any helpful tips.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900458,"PostDate":1436910091,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>having a destination wedding at the RIU Guanacaste November 2015 and would be interested in hearing an honest opinion from someone who had a wedding there. I have been exchanging e-mails with the wedding coordinators which can be a little frustrating since I have a lot of questions. Would hope for my time there to be as stress free as possible but would love to hear about someone's experience and any helpful tips.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristencsalvo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.241.86.225","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436908111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283964.jpg?_r=1437962590","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"k10sal","Id":283964,"Name":"k10sal","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":24,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
