{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":24,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":5150,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1591096,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":252379,"Name":"corbyc","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252379.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1331071552,"LastPoster":{"Id":283964,"Name":"k10sal","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283964.jpg?_r=1437962590","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":71,"Preview":{"Id":1900458,"PostDate":1436910091,"PostContent":"having a destination wedding at the RIU Guanacaste November 2015 and would be interested in heari...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristencsalvo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.241.86.225","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436908111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283964.jpg?_r=1437962590","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"k10sal","Id":283964,"Name":"k10sal","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66259,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8904b2d65bb4382e7bc7dd3ae1bea84b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi There,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My fiance and I are seriously considering being married at the RIU Guanacaste in April of next year.&amp;nbsp; I have been in contact with Barbara from RIU a few times and want some input from people who have been married there.&amp;nbsp; Below are a few questions I currently have but I welcome other input as well (I have never done this before......eeeeek)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 1) Most interested in sunset beach ceremony.&amp;nbsp; Anyone here been married on beach at RIU? How was your experience?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 2) I am concered about the \"semi private\" reception.&amp;nbsp; Does anyone know how they set this up?&amp;nbsp; Anyone paid for a private reception? How much was it?&amp;nbsp; Was it worth it?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 3) Decorations, centerpieces, ect, ect.&amp;nbsp; Who handles all of this?&amp;nbsp; If the hotel does, do they ask you what you want?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks in advance for any input that can be provided.&amp;nbsp;I really appreciate it!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1591096,"PostDate":1331071552,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi There,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My fiance and I are seriously considering being married at the RIU Guanacaste in April of next year.\u00a0 I have been in contact with Barbara from RIU a few times and want some input from people who have been married there.\u00a0 Below are a few questions I currently have but I welcome other input as well (I have never done this before......eeeeek)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 1) Most interested in sunset beach ceremony.\u00a0 Anyone here been married on beach at RIU? How was your experience?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 2) I am concered about the \"semi private\" reception.\u00a0 Does anyone know how they set this up?\u00a0 Anyone paid for a private reception? How much was it?\u00a0 Was it worth it?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 3) Decorations, centerpieces, ect, ect.\u00a0 Who handles all of this?\u00a0 If the hotel does, do they ask you what you want?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks in advance for any input that can be provided.\u00a0I really appreciate it!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"corbycampbell@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1331053820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252379.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"corbyc","Id":252379,"Name":"corbyc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66259,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1873684aeb8752b14b01a260e014006f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; i&#039;ve just came back from Riu and I loved it. I even met with wedding coordinator who gave me a tour.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; So, the beach has a voulcanic sand,so it is not white rather brownish. the beach ceremony is set up between two trees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; the reception is in one of the three restaurants they have, so it may means you will be sharing it with other guests. She told me I could paid extra and have a private reception at their conference centre, but i dont know how much. She told me all info is on riu website but i didnt find pricing for upgrates. I think hotel handels decorations. hope that helps&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1600404,"PostDate":1332965983,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> i've just came back from Riu and I loved it. I even met with wedding coordinator who gave me a tour.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> So, the beach has a voulcanic sand,so it is not white rather brownish. the beach ceremony is set up between two trees.\u00a0<\/p> <p> the reception is in one of the three restaurants they have, so it may means you will be sharing it with other guests. She told me I could paid extra and have a private reception at their conference centre, but i dont know how much. She told me all info is on riu website but i didnt find pricing for upgrates. I think hotel handels decorations. hope that helps<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anna.rusinek@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1330883391,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252271.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Agitka","Id":252271,"Name":"Agitka","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66259,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"af1176725dd11448681241ee4fe7a693","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I would love to hear people&#039;s experiences regarding Riu, too!&amp;nbsp; I am planning a May 2013 wedding there.&amp;nbsp; I just started the process, and I am left wondering how all this works, too.&amp;nbsp; It is supposed to be less stress, but not having done this before I am left feeling lost on how all it works....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1605276,"PostDate":1333977445,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I would love to hear people's experiences regarding Riu, too!\u00a0 I am planning a May 2013 wedding there.\u00a0 I just started the process, and I am left wondering how all this works, too.\u00a0 It is supposed to be less stress, but not having done this before I am left feeling lost on how all it works....<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kc_marie@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1333977356,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253760.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcmarie9","Id":253760,"Name":"kcmarie9","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66259,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f1cd284f7cd2509bba23edb655ffe7ed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi there,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have attended two weddings at RIU Guanacaste in the last two weeks. It&#039;s a nice resort, typical all-inclusive deal, right on the beach. They are currently building a huge extension so there&#039;s a bit of construction noise just now but that should be finished in the next few months. I&#039;m a musician and I played for the ceremony of both weddings right on the beach, then the latin jazz group Los Mojitos played for the reception. You can see photos of the resort and the ceremony at the website livemusicincostarica.com and feel free to contact me if you have any questions.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Good luck with your wedding!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1613754,"PostDate":1335801054,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi there,<\/p> <p> I have attended two weddings at RIU Guanacaste in the last two weeks. It's a nice resort, typical all-inclusive deal, right on the beach. They are currently building a huge extension so there's a bit of construction noise just now but that should be finished in the next few months. I'm a musician and I played for the ceremony of both weddings right on the beach, then the latin jazz group Los Mojitos played for the reception. You can see photos of the resort and the ceremony at the website livemusicincostarica.com and feel free to contact me if you have any questions.<\/p> <p> Good luck with your wedding!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bradmoodie@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1326653939,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249933.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Brad Moodie","Id":249933,"Name":"Brad Moodie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66259,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9050c0d92be5656cbe1ca2872ddddd77","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are too planning a wedding the first week of May 2013. Seriously considering going with RIU. Any feedback?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1641963,"PostDate":1342474845,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are too planning a wedding the first week of May 2013. Seriously considering going with RIU. Any feedback?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Ashliegh13@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1339019842,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256335.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ashliegh","Id":256335,"Name":"Ashliegh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66259,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"48ea087db938ff7501db44601eef5908","RawContent":"I am glad to hear you had a good experience, the reviews scared me. We have also been considering this for May","Attachments":[],"Id":1642215,"PostDate":1342539079,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am glad to hear you had a good experience, the reviews scared me. We have also been considering this for May\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mcvakhwedding@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1341179877,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257336.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MegnAustin","Id":257336,"Name":"MegnAustin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66259,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43f1142e39868e21affc1ff549c91f32","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am also considering the RIU, but I am unsure do to the semi-private recpetions.&amp;nbsp; Can any insight on what they did for the reception.&amp;nbsp; Is there even an option for a DJ?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1644847,"PostDate":1343159242,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am also considering the RIU, but I am unsure do to the semi-private recpetions.\u00a0 Can any insight on what they did for the reception.\u00a0 Is there even an option for a DJ?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anmckenz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1343158993,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258293.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"anmckenz","Id":258293,"Name":"anmckenz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66259,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba0291f5c4c1b896cdffd527160114bb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Have you found out anything more on the reception options?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1644853,"PostDate":1343159704,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Have you found out anything more on the reception options?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anmckenz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1343158993,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258293.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"anmckenz","Id":258293,"Name":"anmckenz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66259,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b8d2917053160949e441dd360c0048f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m a Canadian musician and I live close to Riu Guanacaste. I&#039;ve played there several times for beach ceremonies and dance receptions. I think it&#039;s a great location for destination weddings, close to Liberia Airport, beautiful darker sand beach and with good restaurants. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1645214,"PostDate":1343236060,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm a Canadian musician and I live close to Riu Guanacaste. I've played there several times for beach ceremonies and dance receptions. I think it's a great location for destination weddings, close to Liberia Airport, beautiful darker sand beach and with good restaurants. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bradmoodie@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1326653939,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249933.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Brad Moodie","Id":249933,"Name":"Brad Moodie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66259,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"65c19ce4ea580155a124b9ab5250e689","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey all,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We have our wedding booked at the Riu in March 2013 - we have rented part of the conference centre because our group is fairly big (75), and it&#039;s the only way you can have a microphone and DJ.&amp;nbsp; I have a pricelist and can e-mail it to anyone who is interested, just message me - tanya.mcclure@gmail.com.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Tanya\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1659455,"PostDate":1346683209,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey all,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We have our wedding booked at the Riu in March 2013 - we have rented part of the conference centre because our group is fairly big (75), and it's the only way you can have a microphone and DJ.\u00a0 I have a pricelist and can e-mail it to anyone who is interested, just message me - tanya.mcclure@gmail.com.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Tanya<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tanya.mcclure@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1329323684,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251440.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":115,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CR2013","Id":251440,"Name":"CR2013","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"66259","Title":"-=-Seriously Considering RIU Guanacaste for April 2013 Wedding and Need Any\/All Input-=-","LastPostDate":1436910091},"Pages":{"TotalItems":24,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
