it":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78426,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f0698cfd7151f233220ae2fdd944a79","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi there!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are professional photography company based in Canada. We are planning our personal trip to Costa Rica from Apr 20 to May 5 2015&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a couple who is getting married in Costa Rica within this period. We are expanding our destination wedding portfolio and willing to photograph your wedding absolutely free. Please, let us know if you are interested&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886637,"PostDate":1424207877,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi there!<\/p>\n<p>We are professional photography company based in Canada. We are planning our personal trip to Costa Rica from Apr 20 to May 5 2015<\/p>\n<p>We are looking for a couple who is getting married in Costa Rica within this period. We are expanding our destination wedding portfolio and willing to photograph your wedding absolutely free. Please, let us know if you are interested<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tatiana.a.leonova@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.81.206.115","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424207227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"Formatt