costa rica as well&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847773,"PostDate":1398940438,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am thinking about costa rica as well<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danellepellebon@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"74.190.197.95","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1210202805,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209293.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DelightfulDani","Id":209293,"Name":"DelightfulDani","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.123.208.203","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76247,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d059983568a695860656938278724586","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I got married at the Riu Palace in April and would have some ideas for pricing for extras. I can try and fill in some blanks&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;let me know!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850337,"PostDate":1400096898,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I got married at the Riu Palace in April and would have some ideas for pricing for extras. I can try and fill in some blanks<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0let me know!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angel_142@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"216.123.208.203","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357749474,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264140.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ccoburn142","Id":264140,"Name":"ccoburn142","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.197.178.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76247,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b29554872e9ff0c31005d7a8aa094a1c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks mjhoddi for the 2014 pricing. It&#039;s really helpful.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ll be getting married there in July 2015 and still awaiting on my travel agent for this information...Once I get the new rates for 2015 I will definitely share!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875805,"PostDate":1413398501,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks mjhoddi for the 2014 pricing. It's really helpful.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'll be getting married there in July 2015 and still awaiting on my travel agent for this information...Once I get the new rates for 2015 I will definitely share!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chansone.faymetta@gmail.com","IpAddress":"137.122.30.93","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403529962,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sone","Id":278655,"Name":"Sone","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.35.40.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76247,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61359c44f377b581d8ce5f66360dc6c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"ccoburn142\"] This is a super dumb question. But what restaurants are included at Riu? As in do you have to pay extra to dine at any of them? I&#039;m a little confused, because I thought it was an all inclusive, and than I was reading some small print.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;TIA!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877052,"PostDate":1414429340,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"264140\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/264140-ccoburn142\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ccoburn142<\/span><\/a> This is a super dumb question. But what restaurants are included at Riu? As in do you have to pay extra to dine at any of them? I'm a little confused, because I thought it was an all inclusive, and than I was reading some small print.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>TIA!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wonderlandgrl3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.99.50.82","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407874186,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279411.jpg?_r=1408152053","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mangosong","Id":279411,"Name":"Mangosong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.81.206.115","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76247,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4090402f1135d64b6026acf6e43a92e9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi there!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are professional photography company based in Canada. We are planning our personal trip to Costa Rica from Apr 20 to May 5 2015&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a couple who is getting married in Costa Rica within this period. We are expanding our destination wedding portfolio and willing to photograph your wedding absolutely free. Please, let us know if you are interested&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also, we can offer a wedding style photo shoot if you are already married and have your own wedding dress.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886636,"PostDate":1424207791,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi there!<\/p>\n<p>We are professional photography company based in Canada. We are planning our personal trip to Costa Rica from Apr 20 to May 5 2015<\/p>\n<p>We are looking for a couple who is getting married in Costa Rica within this period. We are expanding our destination wedding portfolio and willing to photograph your wedding absolutely free. Please, let us know if you are interested<\/p>\n<p>Also, we can offer a wedding style photo shoot if you are already married and have your own wedding dress.<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tatiana.a.leonova@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.81.206.115","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424207227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Karizma","Id":282146,"Name":"Karizma","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"76247","Title":"Riu Palace Costa Rica 2015","LastPostDate":1424207791},"Pages":{"TotalItems":8,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
